        prompts: {
          human: 'Three Card Monte (Find the Lady) is a confidence trick: three cards, one queen, are shown then thrown face-down; the punter bets on which is the queen. The dealer may use sleight of hand. Play honestly only with no money.',
          ai: 'Game: Three Card Monte. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay; dealer mixes three cards face-down, punter selects one position; win by correct guess in honest play.',
        },
